://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99030.patch","merged_at":"2024-11-12T15:36:08Z"},"body":"Fixes #95820 \r\n\r\n2D version of #96730. Partially an enhancement and partially a fix because previously, editing a `NavigationObstacle2D` was broken if it or any of its ancestor nodes had a rotation, scale, or skew applied.\r\n\r\n~~The only thing missing as far as I can tell is to modify `NavigationObstacle2DEditor` so that the vertices are transformed by the modified safe transform (which prevents non-uniform scaling), as discussed on RocketChat.~~\r\n\r\nEdit: This should now be fully consistent and have feature parity with the 3D version of this PR. But I have not tested it extensively and the code may not be completely in line with Godot's conventions and guidelines, would need someone more familiar with the codebase to review and give feedback on it please 🙂","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99030/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeli